# 📊 Sales Analysis Project

## 📁 Dataset

* Superstore.csv

## 🛠️ Tools Used

* Microsoft Excel

  * Pivot Tables
  * VLOOKUP
  * Data Cleaning

## 📌 Objective

Analyze sales and profit data to identify trends, top-performing categories, and business insights.

---

## 📊 Analysis Screens

### 🔹 Sales by Segment

![Segment](screenshots/sales-performance-by-segment.png)

### 🔹 Category Performance

![Category](screenshots/category-performance-analysis.png)

### 🔹 Region-wise Analysis

![Region](screenshots/region-sales-profit-analysis.png)

### 🔹 Sub-Category Breakdown

![SubCategory](screenshots/sub-category-sales-profit-analysis.png)

---

## 🔍 Key Insights

* Consumer segment generated the highest sales
* Technology category was the most profitable
* West region led in both sales and profit
* Some sub-categories like Tables and Bookcases showed losses

---

## 🎯 Outcome

Converted raw data into meaningful insights to support business decision-making.

---

## 🚀 Future Improvements

* Build interactive dashboard
